OL,3,GNEWSAMan shut shop door before alleged
OL,4,Arape, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of raping a woman in a
OL,7,Fbarbershop closed the door to the
OL,8,Fpremises and took her out of sight to
OL,9,Fcarry out the alleged attack, a court
OL,10,Fhas heard.
OL,12,FJowad Haji, 24, is accused of raping
OL,13,Fthe woman in Barberia in
OL,14,FStratford-upon-Avon in January after
OL,15,Foffering her a job there, Warwick Crown
OL,16,FCourt was told.
OL,18,FHaji, of Coventry, denies rape,
OL,19,Fattempted rape, sexual assault, a
OL,20,Fseparate sexual assault offence, and
OL,21,Fintentional strangulation.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
